// ALL VALUES BELOW ARE PROVISIONAL PLACEHOLDERS ("status": "Provisional"). No official
// HealthRater tables for these parameters were supplied; the numbers reproduce the
// heuristics the app has used so far, so existing scores are unchanged. Replace them with
// the official tables (and set "status": "Official") without changing any code.
//
// Selection for (parameter, sex, age): an entry for that exact sex beats a sex-neutral
// one ("sex": null); the age must lie in [minAge, maxAge]. Every parameter listed here
// must resolve to exactly one entry for Male and Female at every age 18–100 — the API
// refuses to start otherwise and reports what is missing or overlapping.
//
// Methods:
//   IdealCenter    score = 10 − |value − center| × penaltyPerUnit
//   UpperThreshold score = 10 − max(0, value − idealMax) × penaltyPerUnit
//   RatioToNorm    score = value ÷ norm × 10
//   Bands          first band with min ≤ value < max ("min"/"max" may be omitted)
// Scores are rounded and clamped to 1–10.
//
// Example of an age-specific table (not active):
//   { "parameterKey": "bodyFat", "sex": "Male", "minAge": 40, "maxAge": 59, "method": "Bands",
//     "bands": [ { "max": 11, "score": 8 }, { "min": 11, "max": 22, "score": 10 }, { "min": 22, "score": 6 } ] }
